		answer:
			'Righteousness means being right with our Father and right in how we treat one another. It describes our Father’s own faithfulness, the right standing He gives to those who trust Him, and the life that grows from it. Jesus says, “seek first our Father’s kingdom and his righteousness” (Matthew 6:33).',
	},
